The '''North Wetlands''' are a sub-location of the [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Features ==
The '''North Wetlands''' are a large field where players can harvest {{Item|Mangrove Log}}s. The {{Zone|Red House}} is located here, and the {{Zone|Side-Ember Way}} can be accessed from a pathway over to the left.

